<title>USA: Fedders says Q2 sales off 31 percent.</title>
<headline>Fedders says Q2 sales off 31 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LIBERTY CORNER, N.J. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fedders Corp, the room air conditioner manufacturer, said Monday sales for the second fiscal quarter ended February 28, decreased about 31 percent to approximately $61 million from $88 million in the prior year.</p>
<p>For the six months ended February 28, sales totaled approximately $94 million, a 19 percent decline from $116 million a year ago.</p>
